{"id":"n22142-1-8","stage":3,"title":"올바르다 · 正确","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22142-1-8-1","ko":"아빠, 생신 때 제가 뭘 해드릴까요?","zh":"爸爸，您生日时我为您做点什么好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠,","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}},{"text":"생신","meaning":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","explanation":"생신：寿辰，诞辰，生日","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"해드릴까요?","meaning":"做，干；为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"하다：做，干；드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해드릴까요","audio":"/audio/192c2f348f516edef1fb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"17bf3766fa611ae9","term":"생신","zh":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3","entryId":"16595","definition":"(敬语)人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생신"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f07ae7801893de676e6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22142-1-8-2","ko":"아무것도 필요 없단다. 너만 건강하고 올바르게 자라다오.","zh":"什么都不用。你只要健康、正直地长大就好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무것도","meaning":"啥，什么","explanation":"아무것：啥，什么；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아무것","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58274","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무것도","audio":"/audio/7fe97b694951cb3ea1a4.mp3"}},{"text":"필요","meaning":"必要，需要","explanation":"필요：必要，需要","readings":[{"term":"필요","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72405","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필요","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3"}},{"text":"없단다.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；단다：向平辈或晚辈说明自己知道或听到的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없단다","audio":"/audio/603126ee83db4cd10a25.mp3"}},{"text":"너만","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너만","audio":"/audio/46c93c8c929d05c70e85.mp3"}},{"text":"건강하고","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강하다：健康；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"건강하다","audio":"/audio/941cc7ece011b725bcb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17317","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건강하고","audio":"/audio/2a80db6f1ecee64032e4.mp3"}},{"text":"올바르게","meaning":"正确，端正","explanation":"올바르다：正确，端正；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"올바르다","audio":"/audio/0b423b7b0f21a3bb8092.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22142","senseId":"1","lemma":"올바르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올바르게","audio":"/audio/ac6f00a7ed6ce1c9928b.mp3"}},{"text":"자라다오.","meaning":"生长，成长；表示请求（-아/어 다오：请为我做……）","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；달다：表示请求（-아/어 다오：请为我做……）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；오：较传统的 하오 体句末，表示陈述、询问、请求等；不等同于最高敬语。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"},{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62361","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자라다오","audio":"/audio/d5a0259ce98ff5285ad0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e19fcc44c943145","term":"아무것","zh":"啥，什么","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3","entryId":"58274","definition":"表示不确定的某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무걷"]},{"id":"3ceb8b2c14a13750","term":"필요","zh":"必要，需要","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3","entryId":"72405","definition":"必须得有。","pronunciation":["피료"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"941cc7ece011b725","term":"건강하다","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/941cc7ece011b725bcb5.mp3","entryId":"17317","definition":"身体或精神没有异常，很结实或很强大。","pronunciation":["건ː강하다"]},{"id":"0b423b7b0f21a3bb","term":"올바르다","zh":"正确，端正","audio":"/audio/0b423b7b0f21a3bb8092.mp3","entryId":"22142","definition":"语言、相反或行动等遵守规范而没有错误。","pronunciation":["올바르다"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长，成长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"生长，成长","pronunciation":["자라다"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"表示请求（-아/어 다오：请为我做……）","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"62361","definition":"表示请求（-아/어 다오：请为我做……）","pronunciation":["달ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ac4fe9d53ca164877f4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.207,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=22142","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["什么都不用。你只要健康、正直地长大就好了。","爸爸，您生日时我为您做点什么好？","那个人是谁啊，为什么周围有那么多人聚在一起？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爸爸，您生日时我为您做点什么好？","那个人是谁啊，为什么周围有那么多人聚在一起？","什么都不用。你只要健康、正直地长大就好了。"],"answer":2}]}
